{"id": 13, "title": "Day 13", "topic": "Colours, clothes and adjectives", "words": [{"kind": "adj", "g": "adj", "ru": "кра́сный", "en": "red", "pic": "red_circle.png", "note": "кра́сный, кра́сная, кра́сное, кра́сные. Кра́сная пло́щадь = Red Square.", "id": "d13w1", "pr": "KRAS-nih", "audio": "2db23b411a.mp3", "lemmas": ["кра́сный"]}, {"kind": "adj", "g": "adj", "ru": "си́ний", "en": "(dark) blue", "pic": "blue_circle.png", "note": "A “soft” adjective: си́ний, си́няя, си́нее, си́ние. Light blue is a different colour in Russian: голубо́й.", "id": "d13w2", "pr": "SI-niy", "audio": "cc1b5e30aa.mp3", "lemmas": ["си́ний"]}, {"kind": "adj", "g": "adj", "ru": "зелёный", "en": "green", "pic": "green_circle.png", "id": "d13w3", "pr": "zi-LYO-nih", "audio": "3d7f0174c4.mp3", "lemmas": ["зелёный"]}, {"kind": "adj", "g": "adj", "ru": "жёлтый", "en": "yellow", "pic": "yellow_circle.png", "id": "d13w4", "pr": "ZHOL-tih", "audio": "af230f9e35.mp3", "lemmas": ["жёлтый"]}, {"kind": "adj", "g": "adj", "ru": "чёрный", "en": "black", "pic": "black_circle.png", "id": "d13w5", "pr": "CHOR-nih", "audio": "d13dce4870.mp3", "lemmas": ["чёрный"]}, {"kind": "adj", "g": "adj", "ru": "бе́лый", "en": "white", "pic": "white_circle.png", "id": "d13w6", "pr": "BYE-lih", "audio": "aabac279a9.mp3", "lemmas": ["бе́лый"]}, {"kind": "noun", "g": "m", "ru": "цвет", "en": "colour", "pic": "red_circle.png", "note": "Како́го цве́та…? = What colour is…? (genitive).", "id": "d13w7", "pr": "tsvyet", "audio": "ad485e90ae.mp3", "lemmas": ["цвет"]}, {"kind": "noun", "g": "f", "ru": "ку́ртка", "en": "jacket", "pic": "coat.png", "id": "d13w8", "pr": "KURT-ka", "audio": "0dabe2dcff.mp3", "lemmas": ["ку́ртка"]}, {"kind": "noun", "g": "f", "ru": "руба́шка", "en": "shirt", "pic": "t-shirt.png", "id": "d13w9", "pr": "ru-BASH-ka", "audio": "43a1321375.mp3", "lemmas": ["руба́шка"]}, {"kind": "noun", "g": "pl", "ru": "брю́ки", "en": "trousers", "pic": "jeans.png", "note": "Only plural, like English “trousers”: мои́ брю́ки.", "id": "d13w10", "pr": "BRYU-ki", "audio": "2577467107.mp3", "lemmas": ["брю́ки"]}, {"kind": "noun", "g": "f", "ru": "ша́пка", "en": "hat (warm)", "pic": "billed_cap.png", "id": "d13w11", "pr": "SHAP-ka", "audio": "e0ed8ad20d.mp3", "lemmas": ["ша́пка"]}, {"kind": "verb", "g": "verb", "ru": "носи́ть", "en": "to wear (usually)", "pic": "scarf.png", "note": "ношу́, но́сишь, но́сит… (с → ш in the я form).", "table": {"cols": ["", "present"], "rows": [["я", "ношу́"], ["ты", "но́сишь"], ["он / она́", "но́сит"], ["мы", "но́сим"], ["вы", "но́сите"], ["они́", "но́сят"]]}, "id": "d13w12", "pr": "na-SIT'", "audio": "5168c28e57.mp3", "lemmas": ["носи́ть"]}], "notes": [{"h": "Colours are adjectives", "lines": ["They agree like all adjectives: кра́сный (m), кра́сная (f), кра́сное (n), кра́сные (pl).", "си́ний is soft: си́ний, си́няя, си́нее, си́ние.", "Russian has two blues: си́ний (dark blue) and голубо́й (light / sky blue)."]}, {"h": "Asking about colour", "lines": ["Како́го цве́та…? = What colour is…? Како́го цве́та твоя́ ку́ртка? — Кра́сная."]}, {"h": "I like", "lines": ["Мне нра́вится + singular thing: Мне нра́вится э́та ку́ртка.", "Мне нра́вятся + plural: Мне нра́вятся э́ти брю́ки.", "The thing is the subject; the person is in the dative (мне, тебе́, ему́, ей…)."]}, {"h": "Wearing", "lines": ["носи́ть = wear (usually, habitually): Я ношу́ очки́ (I wear glasses).", "на мне… = I'm wearing (right now), literally “on me (is)”: На мне кра́сная ку́ртка."]}], "tables": [{"title": "Adjective endings: кра́сный", "cols": ["", "masc.", "fem.", "neut.", "plural"], "rows": [["nominative", "кра́сный", "кра́сная", "кра́сное", "кра́сные"], ["accusative", "кра́сный*", "кра́сную", "кра́сное", "кра́сные*"], ["prepositional", "кра́сном", "кра́сной", "кра́сном", "кра́сных"]]}], "sentences": [{"word": "d13w1", "ru": "У меня́ кра́сная ку́ртка.", "en": "I have a red jacket.", "pics": ["red_circle.png", "coat.png"], "why": ["кра́сная — feminine, agreeing with ку́ртка (-ая)."], "id": "d13s1", "pr": "u mi-NYA KRAS-na-ya KURT-ka", "audio": "95bff03f3b.mp3"}, {"word": "d13w1", "ru": "Кра́сный — мой люби́мый цвет.", "en": "Red is my favourite colour.", "pics": ["red_circle.png", "red_heart.png"], "why": ["Кра́сный — masculine, because цвет is masculine.", "люби́мый — favourite."], "id": "d13s2", "pr": "KRAS-nih moi lyu-BI-mih tsvyet", "audio": "9a5b20fbfb.mp3"}, {"word": "d13w2", "ru": "Я ношу́ си́ние брю́ки.", "en": "I wear blue trousers.", "pics": ["blue_circle.png", "jeans.png"], "why": ["ношу́ — носи́ть, я form (с → ш).", "си́ние — plural soft adjective: -ие (брю́ки is plural)."], "id": "d13s3", "pr": "ya na-SHU SI-ni-ye BRYU-ki", "audio": "0770c673ac.mp3"}, {"word": "d13w2", "ru": "Не́бо си́нее.", "en": "The sky is blue.", "pics": ["blue_circle.png", "sun.png"], "why": ["си́нее — neuter soft adjective -ее, because не́бо (sky) is neuter."], "id": "d13s4", "pr": "NYE-ba SI-ni-ye", "audio": "8bd61fda0b.mp3"}, {"word": "d13w3", "ru": "Ла́твия — о́чень зелёная страна́.", "en": "Latvia is a very green country.", "pics": ["green_circle.png", "national_park.png"], "why": ["зелёная — feminine, agreeing with страна́ (country). ё is always stressed."], "id": "d13s5", "pr": "LAT-vi-ya O-chin' zi-LYO-na-ya stra-NA", "audio": "b4cb88cf14.mp3"}, {"word": "d13w4", "ru": "Такси́ жёлтое.", "en": "The taxi is yellow.", "pics": ["yellow_circle.png", "taxi.png"], "why": ["жёлтое — neuter, because такси́ is neuter (foreign words ending in a vowel)."], "id": "d13s6", "pr": "tak-SI ZHOL-ta-ye", "audio": "08ca3abc2c.mp3"}, {"word": "d13w5", "ru": "Мой кот чёрный.", "en": "My cat is black.", "pics": ["black_circle.png", "cat.png"], "why": ["чёрный — masculine (кот). Adjective after the noun = “is black”."], "id": "d13s7", "pr": "moi kot CHOR-nih", "audio": "763df8d6ec.mp3"}, {"word": "d13w6", "ru": "Он но́сит бе́лую руба́шку.", "en": "He wears a white shirt.", "pics": ["white_circle.png", "t-shirt.png"], "why": ["но́сит — носи́ть, он form.", "бе́лую руба́шку — accusative feminine: adjective -ую, noun -у."], "id": "d13s8", "pr": "on NO-sit BYE-lu-yu ru-BASH-ku", "audio": "5e79020e03.mp3"}, {"word": "d13w7", "ru": "Како́го цве́та твоя́ маши́на?", "en": "What colour is your car?", "pics": ["automobile.png", "red_question_mark.png"], "why": ["Како́го цве́та — “of what colour”: genitive of како́й цвет. Fixed question."], "id": "d13s9", "pr": "ka-KO-va TSVYE-ta tva-YA ma-SHI-na", "audio": "1ce608e282.mp3"}, {"word": "d13w8", "ru": "Э́то моя́ но́вая ку́ртка.", "en": "This is my new jacket.", "pics": ["coat.png", "sparkles.png"], "why": ["моя́ но́вая — both feminine, agreeing with ку́ртка."], "id": "d13s10", "pr": "E-ta ma-YA NO-va-ya KURT-ka", "audio": "1543bcdc68.mp3"}, {"word": "d13w8", "ru": "Без ку́ртки хо́лодно.", "en": "It's cold without a jacket.", "pics": ["coat.png", "cold_face.png"], "why": ["Без + genitive: ку́ртка → ку́ртки (after к: и, not ы)."], "id": "d13s11", "pr": "byez KURT-ki KHO-lad-na", "audio": "f5c998d3de.mp3"}, {"word": "d13w9", "ru": "Мне нра́вится твоя́ руба́шка.", "en": "I like your shirt.", "pics": ["t-shirt.png", "thumbs_up.png"], "why": ["Мне нра́вится — “to me is pleasing” = I like: the thing liked is the SUBJECT (nominative), the person is in the dative."], "id": "d13s12", "pr": "mnye NRA-vi-tsya tva-YA ru-BASH-ka", "audio": "4913381b2f.mp3"}, {"word": "d13w10", "ru": "Где мои́ брю́ки?", "en": "Where are my trousers?", "pics": ["jeans.png", "red_question_mark.png"], "why": ["мои́ — plural, because брю́ки is always plural."], "id": "d13s13", "pr": "gdye ma-I BRYU-ki", "audio": "3b8fa15dc2.mp3"}, {"word": "d13w11", "ru": "Зимо́й в Ри́ге ну́жна ша́пка.", "en": "In winter in Riga you need a hat.", "pics": ["billed_cap.png", "snowflake.png"], "why": ["Зимо́й — in winter.", "ну́жна — “necessary”, feminine short form agreeing with ша́пка: ша́пка (is) needed."], "id": "d13s14", "pr": "zi-MOI v RI-gye NUZH-na SHAP-ka", "audio": "154d385d60.mp3"}, {"word": "d13w12", "ru": "Что ты обы́чно но́сишь?", "en": "What do you usually wear?", "pics": ["scarf.png", "thinking_face.png"], "why": ["обы́чно — usually.", "но́сишь — носи́ть, ты form: habitual action."], "id": "d13s15", "pr": "shto tih a-BIHCH-na NO-sish'", "audio": "4a83d5533c.mp3"}, {"mk": "{Кра́сн|ый} {цвет}", "g": "m", "case": "adjective + masculine", "en": "red colour", "pics": ["red_circle.png"], "why": ["Masculine: -ый."], "id": "d13s16", "ru": "Кра́сный цвет", "pr": "KRAS-nih tsvyet", "audio": "06ca99bef4.mp3"}, {"mk": "{Кра́сн|ая} {ку́ртк|а}", "g": "f", "case": "adjective + feminine", "en": "a red jacket", "pics": ["red_circle.png", "coat.png"], "why": ["Feminine: -ая."], "id": "d13s17", "ru": "Кра́сная ку́ртка", "pr": "KRAS-na-ya KURT-ka", "audio": "cbf4ebe21f.mp3"}, {"mk": "{Кра́сн|ое} {я́блок|о}", "g": "n", "case": "adjective + neuter", "en": "a red apple", "pics": ["red_apple.png"], "why": ["Neuter: -ое."], "id": "d13s18", "ru": "Кра́сное я́блоко", "pr": "KRAS-na-ye YAB-la-ka", "audio": "3693d9481e.mp3"}, {"mk": "{Кра́сн|ые} {брю́к|и}", "g": "pl", "case": "adjective + plural", "en": "red trousers", "pics": ["red_circle.png", "jeans.png"], "why": ["Plural: -ые (any gender)."], "id": "d13s19", "ru": "Кра́сные брю́ки", "pr": "KRAS-nih-ye BRYU-ki", "audio": "f711634a32.mp3"}, {"mk": "Я ношу́ {чёрн|ую} {ша́пк|у}.", "g": "f", "case": "accusative: what I wear", "en": "I wear a black hat.", "pics": ["black_circle.png", "billed_cap.png"], "why": ["Accusative feminine: adjective -ую, noun -у."], "id": "d13s20", "ru": "Я ношу́ чёрную ша́пку.", "pr": "ya na-SHU CHOR-nu-yu SHAP-ku", "audio": "5eeb9261bc.mp3"}, {"mk": "Я ви́жу {бе́л|ый} {авто́бус}.", "g": "m", "case": "accusative: masculine thing", "en": "I see a white bus.", "pics": ["white_circle.png", "bus.png"], "why": ["Accusative of a masculine thing = nominative: nothing changes."], "id": "d13s21", "ru": "Я ви́жу бе́лый авто́бус.", "pr": "ya VI-zhu BYE-lih av-TO-bus", "audio": "12677d4c25.mp3"}], "video": "videos/day13.mp4"}